# banso-generated-gitignore v3
# Everything under .banso/ is local runtime state unless named below.
# Banso refreshes this block; add your own rules AFTER the end marker.
*
!.gitignore
# Project configuration and policy -- authored, reviewed, shared with the team.
!config.yaml
!workflows/
!workflows/**
!gates.yaml
!architecture.toml
!labels.yaml
!teams/
!teams/**
# Connector trust. `plugin-trusted-keys.toml` holds PUBLIC signing keys --
# it is the file that makes a signature checkable, not a secret.
!mcp-servers.yaml
!plugin-trusted-keys.toml
# Ratchet baselines: generated, but gates fail closed without them, so they
# are configuration in every sense that matters here.
!*-baseline.json
!*-baseline.toml
# Installed plugin artifacts are regenerable; the lockfile that pins them
# is not.
!plugins/
!plugins/banso-plugins.lock
# banso-generated-gitignore end
